#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-migration.php
msgid "Barrio Suite Migration"
msgstr "Barrio Suite Migration"

#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-migration.php
msgid ""
"Moves forms, entries, files, settings and shortcodes from Suite Barrio, the "
"previous plugin, with the WP-CLI command wp barrio forms migrate, and its "
"SEO with wp barrio seo migrate. Once done, it can be removed."
msgstr ""
"Trasferisce form, registrazioni, file, impostazioni e shortcode da Suite "
"Barrio, il plugin precedente, con il comando WP-CLI wp barrio forms migrate, "
"e il suo SEO con wp barrio seo migrate. Al termine puoi rimuoverlo."

#. Author of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-migration.php
msgid "Hellobarrio"
msgstr "Hellobarrio"

#: forms.php:350
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Avanti"

#. translators: 1: dry run command, 2: migration command.
#: seo.php:68
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The SEO module of Barrio Suite stays off until the SEO of Suite Barrio is "
"migrated: run %1$s, then %2$s. Turned on before, it prints the meta tags "
"twice."
msgstr ""
"Il modulo SEO di Barrio Suite resta spento finché il SEO di Suite Barrio non "
"è migrato: esegui %1$s, poi %2$s. Acceso prima, stampa i meta tag due volte."
